msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: PWSF codec 15/15\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"X-PWSF-Source: codec\n"
"X-PWSF-Entries: 182\n"


#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 7927..9013
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/10
msgid ""
"Use your observations from a field test\n"
"to make any adjustments.\n"
msgstr ""
"根据实地测试的观察结果\n"
"进行调整。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 9027..9571
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/11
msgid ""
"A work in progress, huh?\n"
msgstr ""
"还在完善？\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/0
msgid ""
"Who would have thought that little girl\n"
"was working against us...\n"
msgstr ""
"谁能想到那个小女孩\n"
"竟在跟我们作对……\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/1
msgid ""
"Tell me about it. She had everybody\n"
"fooled. Me included.\n"
msgstr ""
"可不是嘛。她把所有人都\n"
"骗了。包括我。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/2
msgid ""
"I can't believe I didn't pick up on anything.\n"
msgstr ""
"真不敢相信我一点都没察觉。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/3
msgid ""
"Snake, there's no point beating yourself\n"
"up over the past.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，过去的事\n"
"自责也没用。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/4
msgid ""
"But hey,\n"
msgstr ""
"不过话说回来，\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/5
msgid ""
"maybe you should put in some practice\n"
"against ZEKE in case this sort of thing\n"
"ever happens again?\n"
msgstr ""
"也许你该拿ZEKE\n"
"练练手，以防\n"
"再出这种事？\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/6
msgid ""
"In any case, I need to go talk to Dr.\n"
"Strangelove.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之，我得去跟\n"
"斯特兰奇洛夫博士谈谈。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/7
msgid ""
"ZEKE still isn't ready.\n"
msgstr ""
"ZEKE还没好。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/8
msgid ""
"Huey!\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊！\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/0
msgid ""
"Listen, Boss,\n"
msgstr ""
"听我说，BOSS，\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 292..1086
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/1
msgid ""
"we both know you're the reason MSF's\n"
"grown so much.\n"
msgstr ""
"你我都清楚，MSF能有今天\n"
"全靠你。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 1100..1964
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/2
msgid ""
"But it's time we started putting more\n"
"thought into provisions.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我们也该多考虑\n"
"后勤补给了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 1964..3106
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/3
msgid ""
"Good point. A place this big needs a good\n"
"stockpile on hand.\n"
msgstr ""
"有道理。这么大的地方\n"
"得有充足的储备。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 3120..4082
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/4
msgid ""
"The Japanese say, \"You can't fight on an\n"
"empty stomach.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"日本的谚语说，\n"
"“饿着肚子打不了仗。”\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 4109..4736
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/5
msgid ""
"Something we learned in World War II.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是二战给我们的教训。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 5196..6561
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/7
msgid ""
"Maintaining a steady supply of provisions\n"
"is one of the basic principles of logistics.\n"
msgstr ""
"保持稳定的补给\n"
"是后勤的基本原则之一。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 6575..7300
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/8
msgid ""
"So I went ahead and set up a Mess Hall\n"
"Team.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以我组建了\n"
"食堂班。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/9
msgid ""
"The team members' numbers and abilities\n"
"will affect the amount of grub to go\n"
"around.\n"
msgstr ""
"队员的人数和能力\n"
"会影响\n"
"食物的供应量。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/10
msgid ""
"Without enough food, morale will drop.\n"
msgstr ""
"食物不够，士气就会下降。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/11
msgid ""
"They get hungry enough, and we could\n"
"start losing people.\n"
msgstr ""
"饿急了，\n"
"我们可能会开始流失人手。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/12
msgid ""
"Anyway, I need you to assign guys to the\n"
"Mess Hall Team.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之，需要你派人\n"
"去食堂班。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/0
msgid ""
"Boss, one more thing...\n"
msgstr ""
"BOSS，还有事……\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/1
msgid ""
"Now what?\n"
msgstr ""
"又怎么了？\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/2
msgid ""
"It's about sick bay.\n"
msgstr ""
"关于医务室。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/3
msgid ""
"Naturally, we can use it for the sick or\n"
"injured, like we did with Amanda.\n"
msgstr ""
"当然，可以收治伤病员，\n"
"就像阿曼达那样。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/4
msgid ""
"But we can't expect people to get better\n"
"without the proper treatment.\n"
msgstr ""
"但没有适当的治疗，\n"
"人是不可能康复的。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/5
msgid ""
"...Uh huh.\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯嗯。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/6
msgid ""
"So I figure we'll need a Medical Team for\n"
"that.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以我想得有个医疗团队来\n"
"处理。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/7
msgid ""
"The number of team members, and their\n"
"abilities will determine how quickly the\n"
"sick and injured heal.\n"
msgstr ""
"队员的数量以及他们的\n"
"能力将决定伤病员\n"
"恢复的速度。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/8
msgid ""
"They can also monitor everybody's health.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们还能监控大家健康。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/9
msgid ""
"Right. Prevention is the best medicine.\n"
msgstr ""
"对。预防胜于治疗。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/11
msgid ""
"Remember to wash your hands often and\n"
"gargle twice a day, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"老大，记得要勤洗手，\n"
"每天漱口两次。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/12
msgid ""
"If only I had the time.\n"
msgstr ""
"哪有那时间。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396580/0
msgid ""
"Boss! I had an idea. Listen to this.\n"
msgstr ""
"BOSS！我有主意。听我说。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 794..1156
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/1
msgid ""
"Lemme guess.\n"
msgstr ""
"让我猜猜。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 1198..2201
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/2
msgid ""
"You want to start running ads in the local\n"
"gossip rags.\n"
msgstr ""
"你想在当地的\n"
"八卦小报上投放广告。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 2243..2883
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/3
msgid ""
"Please, what do you take me for?\n"
msgstr ""
"拜托，你把我当什么？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 2967..4137
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/4
msgid ""
"I thought that with all the new guys we've\n"
"got, we should get an Intel Team going.\n"
msgstr ""
"我想着既然我们有了这么多\n"
"新人，应该组建一个情报团队。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 4179..5210
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/5
msgid ""
"We'd send agents around the country to\n"
"scout out different locations.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们会派特工到全国各地\n"
"侦察不同的地点。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 5280..6227
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/6
msgid ""
"That way we're better prepared - no\n"
"matter where we end up.\n"
msgstr ""
"这样准备更充分，无论\n"
"最终落脚在哪。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 6436..7230
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/7
msgid ""
"That's actually not a bad idea.\n"
msgstr ""
"这主意倒是不错。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 7230..8178
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/8
msgid ""
"They could probably develop recon\n"
"equipment for us, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们或许还能为我们\n"
"开发侦察设备。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 8192..9376
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/9
msgid ""
"We could also have them transport goods\n"
"and direct the Mother Base support\n"
"strikes.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们还可以让他们运输货物\n"
"并指挥母基地的支援\n"
"打击。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 9501..10644
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/10
msgid ""
"You can send an item to a Co-Op\n"
"teammate from the \"DELIVERY\" Menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以从“DELIVERY”菜单向\n"
"合作队友发送物品。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396990/0
msgid ""
"Hey, Boss, you mind if we powwow for a\n"
"sec?\n"
msgstr ""
"嘿，老大，聊两句\n"
"行吗？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 891..1755
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/1
msgid ""
"What now? MSF-brand rations?\n"
msgstr ""
"又怎么了？MSF口粮？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 1769..2424
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/2
msgid ""
"Actually, that sounds - No, no!\n"
msgstr ""
"其实听起来——不不！\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 2438..3845
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/3
msgid ""
"With all the men we have now, it may be\n"
"time we started sending some of them to\n"
"other countries.\n"
msgstr ""
"以我们现在的人手，也许是时候\n"
"开始派一些人去\n"
"其他国家了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 3859..4555
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/4
msgid ""
"You mean dispatching mercs?\n"
msgstr ""
"你是说派雇佣兵？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 4583..5294
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/5
msgid ""
"How else are we gonna keep feeding the\n"
"crew we have?\n"
msgstr ""
"不然我们怎么养活\n"
"现有的这帮弟兄？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 5322..5851
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/6
msgid ""
"I know... You're right.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道……你说得对。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 5879..7230
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/7
msgid ""
"Okay. To deploy troops, select \"Outer\n"
"Ops\" from the Mother Base Menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"好的。部署部队请从母基地菜单\n"
"选“外勤任务”。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 7230..7606
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/8
msgid ""
"If it goes really well,\n"
msgstr ""
"如果一切顺利，\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 7634..8930
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/9
msgid ""
"we might even get new recruits, weapon\n"
"design specs, or leads on new missions.\n"
msgstr ""
"甚至可能招到新人、拿到武器开发规格，\n"
"或新任务线索。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 8944..10212
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/10
msgid ""
"We can deploy any vehicles or large-scale\n"
"weapons in our arsenal as well.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们也可以部署军械库中的任何车辆或\n"
"大型武器。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 10226..10950
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/11
msgid ""
"And if things don't go \"really well\"...?\n"
msgstr ""
"要是不太顺利呢……？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 10950..11563
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/12
msgid ""
"Yeah. We could lose men.\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊。可能会损失人手。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 11591..12650
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/13
msgid ""
"I won't try and force you. You're the one\n"
"calling the shots here, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不会强迫你。这里由你\n"
"说了算，老板。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396e60/0
msgid ""
"Boss, I'm starting to wonder if recruiting\n"
"soldiers with the Fulton isn't a little...\n"
"heavy-handed?\n"
msgstr ""
"老大，我开始觉得用富尔顿\n"
"抓人入伍是不是有点……\n"
"太强硬了？\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396e60/1
msgid ""
"I already don't like where this is going...\n"
msgstr ""
"我已经不喜欢这走向了……\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396e60/2
msgid ""
"I think the voluntary approach could be\n"
"more pragmatic.\n"
msgstr ""
"我觉得自愿的方式\n"
"更实际些。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396e60/3
msgid ""
"Technically we're not a corporate entity,\n"
msgstr ""
"严格来说我们不是企业实体，\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396e60/4
msgid ""
"but at our size that's not too far from\n"
"the truth.\n"
msgstr ""
"但以我们的规模，\n"
"也差不了多少。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/0
msgid ""
"Package for you, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"有你的包裹，BOSS。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 599..1226
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/2
msgid ""
"Yeah. Looks like a cassette tape.\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯。看起来是盒磁带。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 1267..2215
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/3
msgid ""
"Don't worry, it's clean. No trace of\n"
"explosives or anything.\n"
msgstr ""
"别担心，很干净。没有爆炸物或\n"
"任何痕迹。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 2243..2967
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/4
msgid ""
"Return address just says \"EVA.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"寄件人只写了“EVA”。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 2995..3232
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/5
msgid ""
"EVA...\n"
msgstr ""
"EVA……\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 3260..3524
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/6
msgid ""
"Someone you know?\n"
msgstr ""
"你认识？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 3831..4444
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/7
msgid ""
"Old... acquaintance.\n"
msgstr ""
"老……相识。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 4527..5670
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/8
msgid ""
"Ho ho hooo, the plot thickens. Tidings\n"
"from an old flame?\n"
msgstr ""
"呵呵呵，越来越有意思了。旧情人\n"
"来信？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 5670..6979
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/9
msgid ""
"Don't start, Kaz. Anyway, I'll check it out\n"
"later.\n"
msgstr ""
"别说了，Kaz。总之我稍后\n"
"去看。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 6979..7857
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/10
msgid ""
"OK, just don't go running off after this\n"
"chick.\n"
msgstr ""
"好吧，只是别之后跑去追那\n"
"女人。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 7913..8791
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/11
msgid ""
"We can't afford for you to be \"distracted\"\n"
"right now.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们现在可承受不起你\n"
"“分心”。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/0
msgid ""
"Got anything you can use to blow up that\n"
"barricade?\n"
msgstr ""
"你有啥能炸掉那个\n"
"路障的？\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/1
msgid ""
"Don't think so...\n"
msgstr ""
"应该没有…\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/2
msgid ""
"It depends on what kind of barricade it is,\n"
"but...\n"
msgstr ""
"得看那是什么样的路障，\n"
"不过……\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/3
msgid ""
"I'm gonna need some powerful explosives.\n"
msgstr ""
"我需要强力炸药。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/4
msgid ""
"Think you could work something up at\n"
"Mother Base?\n"
msgstr ""
"你觉得能在母基地\n"
"做出点什么吗？\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/5
msgid ""
"How about asking the R&D team to make you\n"
"C4 explosives?\n"
msgstr ""
"让研发团队给你做C4炸药\n"
"怎么样？\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/6
msgid ""
"If we don't have enough manpower, you'll\n"
"have to go find some somewhere...\n"
msgstr ""
"如果我们人手不够，你就\n"
"得去别处找一些……\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/7
msgid ""
"But first, see what we've got going on at\n"
"Mother Base, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过先看看母基地\n"
"有啥进展吧，Snake。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the C4 we're working on right now\n"
"will help you blow a hole in that barricade.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，我们现在正在研发的C4\n"
"能帮你在那道路障上炸开一个洞。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/1
msgid ""
"Give us a little more time to finish it.\n"
msgstr ""
"再给我们点时间完成它。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/2
msgid ""
"Alright.\n"
msgstr ""
"好。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/3
msgid ""
"Just be aware that if we run out of GMP,\n"
msgstr ""
"只是要记住，GMP一旦用完，\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/4
msgid ""
"work's going to grind to a halt, and we'll\n"
"have to add some folks to the Combat\n"
"Unit.\n"
msgstr ""
"工作会陷入停滞，我们就\n"
"得往战斗\n"
"部队里添些人手了。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/5
msgid ""
"I'll keep it in mind.\n"
msgstr ""
"我会记住的。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397a80/0
msgid ""
"Snake, I've got just the explosive to bust\n"
"through that barricade - C4.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，我正好有能炸穿\n"
"那道路障的炸药——C4。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397a80/1
msgid ""
"We've finished developing C4 charges.\n"
"Take some with you.\n"
msgstr ""
"C4炸药已研发完成。\n"
"带上一些吧。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397ba0/0
msgid ""
"Snake! Weapons and items development\n"
"is going nowhere fast.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake！武器和物品的研发\n"
"毫无进展。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397ba0/1
msgid ""
"Send us some more soldiers with the\n"
"Fulton.\n"
msgstr ""
"用富尔顿给我们送\n"
"更多兵来。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397cb0/0
msgid ""
"Snake... If we don't step up weapons and\n"
"items development here,\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake……如果不在这推进武器和\n"
"物品研发，\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397cb0/1
msgid ""
"I think you're gonna have more and more\n"
"problems completing missions down the\n"
"road.\n"
msgstr ""
"我觉得你今后完成任务\n"
"会面临越来越多\n"
"的麻烦。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397df0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, we need more guys for weapons\n"
"and items development.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，需要更多人手搞武器\n"
"和物品研发。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397df0/1
msgid ""
"Get us some new recruits with the Fulton.\n"
msgstr ""
"用富尔顿招些新兵来。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397f00/0
msgid ""
"The Boss has infiltrated the area around\n"
"the coastal supply facility\n"
msgstr ""
"老大已潜入\n"
"沿海补给设施周边\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397f00/1
msgid ""
"and knocked out the soldier there.\n"
msgstr ""
"并打晕了那名士兵。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397f00/2
msgid ""
"But, we can't just leave him there to be\n"
"found.\n"
msgstr ""
"可我们不能把他丢在那里\n"
"等人发现。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398120/0
msgid ""
"Someone's planning to extract enemy\n"
"soldiers via Fulton recovery.\n"
msgstr ""
"有人正打算用富尔顿回收系统\n"
"撤走敌方士兵。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398120/1
msgid ""
"Thwart their attempt by shooting down\n"
"the balloons. We're calling this the\n"
"\"Pooyan Mission.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"击落那些气球，挫败他们的企图。\n"
"我们把这叫做\n"
"“Pooyan任务”。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398120/2
msgid ""
"Support our troops. Shoot those balloons!\n"
msgstr ""
"支援我方。打爆那些气球！\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3982b0/0
msgid ""
"Clear the rubble in the Cloud Forest\n"
"that's blocking our advance.\n"
msgstr ""
"清除云林中阻挡我们前进的\n"
"碎石。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3982b0/1
msgid ""
"Some C4 could make short work of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"用C4很快就能搞定。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3982b0/2
msgid ""
"If you succeed, our efforts in this area\n"
"will be made that much easier.\n"
msgstr ""
"你成功的话，我们在这片区域\n"
"的行动会轻松得多。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/0
msgid ""
"Bad news: the Boss has fallen into enemy\n"
"hands. I'm sure he'll find a way to escape.\n"
msgstr ""
"坏消息：Boss落入了敌人\n"
"手中。我相信他会想办法逃脱的。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/1
msgid ""
"Actually, I'm more worried about his gear.\n"
"He's gonna have a tough time without it.\n"
msgstr ""
"其实，我更担心他的装备。\n"
"没有装备他会很难办。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/2
msgid ""
"That's where you come in.\n"
msgstr ""
"这就要靠你了。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/3
msgid ""
"I need you to sneak in through the\n"
"mine's underground passage and recover\n"
msgstr ""
"我需要你潜入\n"
"矿井的地下通道，取回\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/4
msgid ""
"all of the Boss's equipment.\n"
msgstr ""
"BOSS的所有装备。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/5
msgid ""
"I know you'd like to rescue him yourself,\n"
"but have faith.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道你想亲自救他，\n"
"但要相信他们。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/6
msgid ""
"This will be more than enough. I'll be\n"
"watching you. Good luck.\n"
msgstr ""
"这些足够了。我会\n"
"看着你的。祝你好运。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398700/0
#: codec/2/920/0x3988a0/0
msgid ""
"Enemy reinforcements have been\n"
"dispatched to the underground passage\n"
"at the U.S. Missile Base.\n"
msgstr ""
"敌军增援已派往\n"
"美国导弹基地的\n"
"地下通道。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398700/1
msgid ""
"The problem is, Snake's already there.\n"
msgstr ""
"问题是，SNAKE已经在那了。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398700/2
msgid ""
"You've gotta find a way to defend this\n"
"position. Do not let them break through.\n"
msgstr ""
"你得想办法守住这里。\n"
"别让他们突破。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3988a0/1
msgid ""
"They must not be allowed to enter the\n"
"Control Tower while Snake is there.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE在的时候，绝不能\n"
"让他们进入管制塔。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3988a0/2
msgid ""
"Defend this position. Do whatever it takes\n"
"to prevent the enemy from breaking\n"
"through.\n"
msgstr ""
"守住这里。不惜一切\n"
"阻止敌人\n"
"突破。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/0
msgid ""
"How's Paz doing?\n"
msgstr ""
"帕兹咋样？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 390..1699
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/1
msgid ""
"OK so far. Still shocked about being lied\n"
"to by Zadornov...\n"
msgstr ""
"目前还好。还在为被\n"
"扎多尔诺夫骗了而震惊……\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 1713..2661
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/2
msgid ""
"But she's actually getting along great\n"
"with the crew here at Mother Base.\n"
msgstr ""
"但她跟母基地的人\n"
"相处得挺好。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 2661..2953
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/3
msgid ""
"Really.\n"
msgstr ""
"真的。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 3023..3343
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/4
msgid ""
"That's good to hear.\n"
msgstr ""
"那就好。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 3357..3524
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/5
msgid ""
"Still,\n"
msgstr ""
"不过，\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 3524..4917
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/6
msgid ""
"it's got to be depressing for a girl her\n"
"age to be cooped up on an offshore plant\n"
"all day,\n"
msgstr ""
"她这年纪的女孩，\n"
"整天困在离岸工厂，\n"
"肯定很压抑，\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 4987..5503
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/7
msgid ""
"even if it is only temporary.\n"
msgstr ""
"哪怕只是暂时的。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 5586..6464
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/8
msgid ""
"I bet she'd love it if you took her out\n"
"somewhere once in a while.\n"
msgstr ""
"你要是偶尔带她出去\n"
"她肯定很开心。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/0
msgid ""
"Snake...the sunsets are so pretty here...\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE……这里的夕阳真美……\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/1
msgid ""
"Are you feeling OK, Kaz?\n"
msgstr ""
"没事吧，卡兹？\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/2
msgid ""
"Yeah, I mean...I've got MSF business to\n"
"think about and all,\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯，我是说……我得考虑\n"
"MSF的事，\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/3
msgid ""
"but sometimes it's nice to just sit and\n"
"watch the sunset, you know?\n"
msgstr ""
"但有时坐下来看看夕阳\n"
"也挺好的，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/4
msgid ""
"...Yyyyeah.\n"
msgstr ""
"……是——啊。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/5
msgid ""
"Snake, um...would you be up for going to\n"
"the coast to watch the sunset?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，呃……要不要去\n"
"海边看夕阳？\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/6
msgid ""
"Just the two of us?\n"
msgstr ""
"就我们俩？\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399140/0
msgid ""
"Time for your mission briefing.\n"
msgstr ""
"该做任务简报了。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399140/1
msgid ""
"This is going to be a tough one. Be ready\n"
"for a protracted fight.\n"
msgstr ""
"这会是一场硬仗。做好\n"
"打持久战的准备。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399140/2
msgid ""
"I know you can do it. Get out there and\n"
"kick some ass!\n"
msgstr ""
"你能行。上吧，\n"
"狠狠打他们！\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3992a0/0
msgid ""
"Here's a rundown of your mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是你的任务简报。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3992a0/1
msgid ""
"This one's perfect for a warm up. Nice\n"
"and easy.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个正好用来热身。轻松\n"
"又简单。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3992a0/2
msgid ""
"Don't let yourself get lazy, though. Stick\n"
"to it and get the job done.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过别让自己偷懒。坚持\n"
"下去，把任务完成。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399400/0
msgid ""
"Commencing training mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"开始训练任务。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399400/1
msgid ""
"Missions like this are key to building up\n"
"your basic skills.\n"
msgstr ""
"像这样的任务是打好\n"
"基本功的关键。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399400/2
msgid ""
"Be careful out there.\n"
msgstr ""
"小心点。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/0
msgid ""
"Commencing mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"开始任务。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/1
msgid ""
"You're in for some heavy combat with\n"
"this one.\n"
msgstr ""
"这次你要面对一场\n"
"激烈的战斗。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/2
msgid ""
"Try and make it back in one piece.\n"
msgstr ""
"务必活着回来。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/0
msgid ""
"This is a high-risk mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是高风险任务。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/1
msgid ""
"You'll be facing some powerful opposition.\n"
msgstr ""
"你会面对强劲的敌人。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/2
msgid ""
"But it's nothing you can't handle. Believe\n"
"in yourself.\n"
msgstr ""
"但这难不倒你。相信\n"
"自己。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/0
msgid ""
"We've got a... uh, special request for you\n"
"today.\n"
msgstr ""
"今天有个……呃，\n"
"特别任务给你。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/1
msgid ""
"Yeah...umm...\n"
msgstr ""
"对，嗯\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/2
msgid ""
"Here, have a look.\n"
msgstr ""
"来，看看。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/0
msgid ""
"You're not gonna believe this...\n"
msgstr ""
"你肯定不敢相信……\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/1
msgid ""
"Suddenly we've got a Gear REX on board\n"
"Mother Base and it's raising hell up on\n"
"the deck.\n"
msgstr ""
"突然有一台Gear REX出现在母基地\n"
"上，正在甲板上\n"
"大肆破坏。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/2
msgid ""
"I don't know what we did to piss it\n"
"off...but this is the biggest crisis in MSF's\n"
"history.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不知道我们怎么惹毛了\n"
"它……但这是MSF\n"
"史上最大的危机。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/3
msgid ""
"We need you to hunt it down and save\n"
"our Outer Heaven!\n"
msgstr ""
"需要你猎杀它，拯救\n"
"我们的Outer Heaven！\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/0
msgid ""
"Last night, a Gear REX came ashore on\n"
"the southern Pacific coast of Costa Rica.\n"
msgstr ""
"昨晚，一台Gear REX在\n"
"哥斯达黎加南太平洋沿岸登陆。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/1
msgid ""
"From there it headed north and reached\n"
"the vicinity of Irazú's crater around noon\n"
"today.\n"
msgstr ""
"它从那里向北行进，今天中午\n"
"左右抵达了\n"
"伊拉苏火山口附近。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/2
msgid ""
"As of now it's stopped moving.\n"
msgstr ""
"目前它已停止移动。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/3
msgid ""
"Costa Rica doesn't have an army to deal\n"
"with threats this big.\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加没有军队来应对\n"
"这么大的威胁。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/4
msgid ""
"We're getting dozens of reports of\n"
"damage to nearby houses and other\n"
"buildings.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们收到几十份报告，称\n"
"附近房屋和其他\n"
"建筑受损。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/5
msgid ""
"For the sake of peace in Costa Rica,\n"
msgstr ""
"为了哥斯达黎加的和平，\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/6
msgid ""
"we need you to head to the crater and\n"
"get the Gear REX under control!\n"
msgstr ""
"需要你前往弹坑，\n"
"控制住霸王！\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/0
msgid ""
"It'd be a good idea to do some combat\n"
"training with ZEKE.\n"
msgstr ""
"和ZEKE做点战斗训练\n"
"会很有帮助。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/1
msgid ""
"It'll just be a mock battle, though.\n"
"Nothing'll happen to ZEKE for real.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过只是模拟战。\n"
"ZEKE不会真出事。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/2
msgid ""
"Attack ZEKE as if you were actually going\n"
"against him, OK?\n"
msgstr ""
"就当是真打一样攻击ZEKE，\n"
"确定？\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399f20/0
msgid ""
"dummy\n"
msgstr ""
"假人\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399fb0/0
#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/0
msgid ""
"Commence target practice.\n"
msgstr ""
"开始打靶训练。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a120/0
msgid ""
"Target practice commences now. Shoot\n"
"all the targets in the Kill House!\n"
msgstr ""
"打靶训练开始。射杀\n"
"击杀屋里的所有目标！\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a120/1
#: codec/2/922/0x39a3b0/1
msgid ""
"When the timer reaches zero, the\n"
"exercise is over.\n"
msgstr ""
"计时归零时，\n"
"训练结束。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/1
msgid ""
"As a special treat, you can practice freely\n"
"on any of the targets in the shooting\n"
"range today.\n"
msgstr ""
"作为特别优待，今天可以在靶场\n"
"自由练习射击\n"
"任意目标。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/2
msgid ""
"Shoot away! When you're done, head\n"
"over to the exit.\n"
msgstr ""
"尽情射击！结束后前往\n"
"出口。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a3b0/0
msgid ""
"Target practice commencing now. Shoot\n"
"all the targets in the shooting range!\n"
msgstr ""
"打靶训练开始。射杀\n"
"靶场里的所有目标！\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/0
msgid ""
"Looks like our reputation is spreading.\n"
msgstr ""
"看来我们的名声传开了。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/1
msgid ""
"We've got battle-hardened veterans from\n"
"all kinds of places trying to join our army!\n"
msgstr ""
"各地身经百战的老兵\n"
"都想加入我们的部队！\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/2
msgid ""
"But, they insist on testing your skills to\n"
"see if you're the \"real deal\" before they'll\n"
"join.\n"
msgstr ""
"但他们坚持要先测试你的本事，\n"
"看你是不是\"真货\"，才肯\n"
"加入。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/3
msgid ""
"Lets put these arrogant upstarts in their\n"
"place!\n"
msgstr ""
"让这些狂妄家伙\n"
"认清位置！\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/4
msgid ""
"Take them down using hand-to-hand\n"
"strikes or CQC.\n"
msgstr ""
"用格斗或CQC\n"
"打倒他们。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/5
msgid ""
"If you can knock 'em all out within the\n"
"time limit, they'll join us,\n"
msgstr ""
"只要在时限内全部击倒，\n"
"他们就会加入我们，\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/6
msgid ""
"becoming powerful allies.\n"
msgstr ""
"成为强大的盟友。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/7
msgid ""
"Don't disappoint 'em, Boss. Show 'em\n"
"what you got!\n"
msgstr ""
"别让他们失望，BOSS。亮出\n"
"本事来！\n"
